---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Review starting prices for website development, AI systems and automation, and custom internal software from Static Pulse Sites."
>
  <main>
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Starting prices for focused business systems.</h1>

        <p class="lead hero-lead">
          Every project is scoped around the business problem, the work
          required, and the systems involved. The prices below provide a
          starting point before we review your specific requirements.
        </p>

        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
            Start Your Project
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h2>Website Development</h2>

            <p><strong>Starting at $1,200</strong></p>

            <p>
              For business websites, landing pages, forms, basic SEO,
              analytics, booking connections, and CRM integrations.
            </p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/website-development">
              View Website Development →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h2>AI Systems &amp; Automation</h2>

            <p><strong>Starting at $1,000</strong></p>

            <p>
              For workflow automation, connected tools, document processes,
              email automation, lead handling, reporting, and practical AI
              assistants.
            </p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/ai-systems-automation">
              View AI Systems &amp; Automation →
            </a>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h2>Custom Internal Software</h2>

            <p><strong>Starting at $2,500</strong></p>

            <p>
              For focused portals, dashboards, internal CRMs, onboarding
              systems, document tools, and operational software.
            </p>

            <a class="text-link" href="/services/custom-internal-software">
              View Custom Internal Software →
            </a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>What affects the final price?</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Project Scope</h3>
            <p>
              The number of pages, workflows, users, features, and systems
              involved.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Existing Tools</h3>
            <p>
              Whether we are improving existing systems or building something
              new.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <h3>Integration Requirements</h3>
            <p>
              The number and complexity of platforms, APIs, and data sources
              that need to connect.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <h2>Get a price based on the problem you need to solve.</h2>

          <p class="lead">
            Send us a brief explanation of your business, your current tools,
            and what you want to improve. We will respond by email with the
            appropriate next steps.
          </p>

          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>